msgid "%s is available in the At8 Security Pro add-on."
msgstr "%s 功能在 At8 Security Pro 附加组件中提供。"

msgid "404s allowed per five minutes"
msgstr "每 5 分钟允许的 404 次数"

msgid "A field that people never see but bots happily fill in."
msgstr "真人永远不会看到、而机器人却乐于填写的字段。"

msgid ""
"A hidden field plus a one-comment-per-minute limit for visitors who are not "
"signed in."
msgstr "隐藏字段，外加对未登录访客每分钟一条评论的限制。"

msgid ""
"A hosted anti-bot challenge as an alternative to the arithmetic question"
msgstr "以云端托管的人机验证替代算术题"

msgid ""
"A hosted anti-bot challenge, as an alternative to the arithmetic question,"
msgstr "以云端托管的人机验证替代算术题，"

msgid ""
"A report of accounts that have gone quiet, with the date each was last used"
msgstr "列出长期未使用的账号及其最近一次使用日期"

msgid "A short arithmetic question. Nothing is loaded from a third party."
msgstr "一道简单的算术题，不加载任何第三方资源。"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "账号"

msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "Address locked out"
msgstr "地址已被锁定"

msgid "Alert recipient"
msgstr "提醒接收邮箱"

msgid "All settings have been restored to their defaults."
msgstr "所有设置已恢复为默认值。"

msgid "Allow and block lists"
msgstr "允许与阻止名单"

msgid "Always allowed addresses"
msgstr "始终允许的地址"

msgid "An intruder with an admin session cannot edit PHP from the dashboard."
msgstr "即使入侵者拿到了管理员会话，也无法在后台直接编辑 PHP。"

msgid "Anonymous requests to /wp/v2/users return nothing."
msgstr "匿名请求 /wp/v2/users 不会返回任何数据。"

msgid "Applies when a password is set or changed."
msgstr "在设置或修改密码时生效。"

msgid "At8 Security"
msgstr "At8 Security"

msgid "At8 Security Pro"
msgstr "At8 Security Pro"

msgid ""
"At8 Security Pro is a separate add-on for sites that need more than the "
"essentials. It installs alongside this plugin and adds its features to these"
" same screens — nothing on this page changes when it is absent."
msgstr ""
"At8 Security Pro "
"是独立的附加组件，为需要更多功能的站点而准备。它与本插件一同安装，并把功能加入同样的页面——没有它时，本页面的功能不受任何影响。"

msgid ""
"At8 Security requires PHP %s or newer. The plugin has been disabled to keep "
"your site online."
msgstr "At8 Security 需要 PHP %s 或更高版本。插件已自动停用，以保证站点正常运行。"

msgid "Attempts allowed"
msgstr "允许尝试次数"

msgid "Audit log"
msgstr "审计日志"

msgid "Automatic detection of CDN and proxy address ranges"
msgstr "自动识别 CDN 与代理的地址段"

msgid "Basic hardening"
msgstr "基础加固"

msgid "Block author enumeration"
msgstr "阻止作者枚举"

msgid "Block known scanner user agents"
msgstr "阻止已知的扫描器 User Agent"

msgid "Block script execution in the uploads folder"
msgstr "禁止上传目录执行脚本"

msgid "Blocked addresses"
msgstr "阻止的地址"

msgid "Blocks brute-force attempts and pingback reflection abuse."
msgstr "阻止暴力破解与 pingback 反射滥用。"

msgid "Checked %1$d account(s). These should be changed: %2$s"
msgstr "已检查 %1$d 个账号。以下账号的密码应当修改：%2$s"

msgid ""
"Checked %d account(s): none of them use a password from the common-password "
"list."
msgstr "已检查 %d 个账号：没有账号使用常见弱密码列表中的密码。"

msgid "Clear the log"
msgstr "清空日志"

msgid "Close comments across the site"
msgstr "关闭全站评论"

msgid "Comments"
msgstr "评论"

msgid ""
"Compares stored accounts against a list of the most commonly used passwords."
" Verification is deliberately slow, so a large user base is checked in "
"batches."
msgstr "将站内账号与常见弱密码列表逐一比对。校验刻意放慢速度，用户较多时会分批检查。"

msgid "Content Security Policy"
msgstr "内容安全策略（CSP）"

msgid "Custom login path"
msgstr "自定义登录路径"

msgid "Custom path"
msgstr "自定义路径"

msgid "Detail"
msgstr "详情"

msgid "Directory scanning produces a burst of 404s."
msgstr "目录扫描会产生大量 404 请求。"

msgid "Disable XML-RPC"
msgstr "禁用 XML-RPC"

msgid "Disable the built-in plugin and theme editor"
msgstr "禁用内置的插件与主题编辑器"

msgid "Drops two rarely used head tags."
msgstr "移除两个极少用到的 head 标签。"

msgid "E-mail me about sign-ins from new addresses"
msgstr "新地址登录时给我发邮件提醒"

msgid "Enable HSTS"
msgstr "启用 HSTS"

msgid "Enable request filtering"
msgstr "启用请求过滤"

msgid "Enable the weak-password check in Tools"
msgstr "在「工具」中启用弱密码检查"

msgid "Entries currently stored: %s"
msgstr "当前日志条数：%s"

msgid "Event"
msgstr "事件"

msgid ""
"Every protection below is off-by-default only where switching it on could "
"lock you out. Changes are saved with the button at the bottom of each tab."
msgstr "下方保护项中，只有开启后可能把你自己挡在门外的才默认关闭。所有改动通过每个选项卡底部的按钮保存。"

msgid "Failed sign-in"
msgstr "登录失败"

msgid "File integrity monitoring against a stored baseline"
msgstr "基于基准快照的文件完整性监控"

msgid "Filter comment spam"
msgstr "过滤垃圾评论"

msgid "Firewall"
msgstr "防火墙"

msgid "Hardening"
msgstr "加固"

msgid "Headers & CSP"
msgstr "响应头与 CSP"

msgid "Hidden field trap"
msgstr "隐藏字段陷阱"

msgid "Hide the WordPress version"
msgstr "隐藏 WordPress 版本号"

msgid "Hide user listings from the REST API"
msgstr "在 REST API 中隐藏用户列表"

msgid ""
"Hides the comment form and existing comments, and removes the Comments menu."
" Turning it back off restores everything."
msgstr "隐藏评论表单和已有评论，并移除「评论」菜单。关闭该选项后一切恢复原样。"

msgid "Human check on the login form"
msgstr "登录表单人机验证"

msgid "Human check: what is %1$d + %2$d?"
msgstr "人机验证：%1$d + %2$d 等于多少？"

msgid "Leave empty to use the site administration address."
msgstr "留空则使用站点管理邮箱。"

msgid "Limit failed login attempts"
msgstr "限制登录失败次数"

msgid "Limit repeated 404 responses"
msgstr "限制重复 404 请求"

msgid "Limit request rate per address"
msgstr "按地址限制请求频率"

msgid "Locked for %d minute(s)."
msgstr "已锁定 %d 分钟。"

msgid "Lockout length (minutes)"
msgstr "锁定时长（分钟）"

msgid "Login"
msgstr "登录"

msgid "Login failed."
msgstr "登录失败。"

msgid "Login protection"
msgstr "登录保护"

msgid "Maintenance tools"
msgstr "维护工具"

msgid "Minimum length"
msgstr "最小长度"

msgid "Move the login form to a custom path"
msgstr "把登录表单移到自定义路径"

msgid "Nothing recorded yet."
msgstr "暂无记录。"

msgid "One per line. Single addresses and CIDR ranges are both accepted."
msgstr "每行一条。支持单个 IP 地址和 CIDR 地址段。"

msgid ""
"Only fill this in if your site sits behind a proxy. Forwarded IP headers are"
" trusted from these addresses alone — which is what stops a visitor from "
"pretending to be someone else."
msgstr "仅当站点位于代理之后时填写。转发 IP 请求头只信任来自这些地址的请求——这正是防止访客伪造身份的关键。"

msgid "Password strength"
msgstr "密码强度"

msgid "Policy"
msgstr "策略"

msgid "Pro"
msgstr "Pro"

msgid "Re-apply rules"
msgstr "重新应用规则"

msgid ""
"Re-writes the .htaccess block that backs the directory-listing and uploads "
"settings. Use this after moving the site or editing .htaccess by hand."
msgstr "重写支撑目录列表和上传目录设置的 .htaccess 规则块。迁移站点或手工编辑过 .htaccess 后使用。"

msgid "Read more about Pro"
msgstr "了解更多 Pro 功能"

msgid "Recommended while you check the browser console for violations."
msgstr "建议先在浏览器控制台查看违规报告后再收紧。"

msgid "Redirect front-end traffic to HTTPS"
msgstr "将前台访问重定向到 HTTPS"

msgid "Remove RSD and WLW links"
msgstr "移除 RSD 与 WLW 链接"

msgid "Removes the generator tag and the ?ver= query on styles and scripts."
msgstr "移除 generator 标签以及样式和脚本链接上的 ?ver= 参数。"

msgid "Repeated failures from one address are temporarily refused."
msgstr "同一地址反复失败后将被临时拒绝。"

msgid "Report only (do not block)"
msgstr "仅报告（不拦截）"

msgid "Requests allowed per window"
msgstr "每个时间窗允许的请求数"

msgid "Requests such as ?author=1 are redirected to the home page."
msgstr "类似 ?author=1 的请求会被重定向到首页。"

msgid "Require strong passwords"
msgstr "强制使用强密码"

msgid "Restore defaults"
msgstr "恢复默认"

msgid ""
"Restores every option on this screen to its default value. Nothing else is "
"removed."
msgstr "将本页所有选项恢复为默认值，不会删除其他数据。"

msgid "Reverse proxy or CDN addresses"
msgstr "反向代理或 CDN 地址"

msgid "Run the check"
msgstr "开始检查"

msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "保存更改"

msgid "Security headers"
msgstr "安全响应头"

msgid "Security scanners and empty user agents are refused."
msgstr "拒绝安全扫描器和空 User Agent。"

msgid "Send a CSP header"
msgstr "发送 CSP 响应头"

msgid "Send hardening headers"
msgstr "发送安全加固响应头"

msgid "Sent once per address, not on every login."
msgstr "每个地址只发一次，不会每次登录都发。"

msgid "Server rules"
msgstr "服务器规则"

msgid ""
"Server rules re-applied. They only take effect on Apache — on Nginx, set the"
" equivalent rules in the server block."
msgstr "服务器规则已重新应用。仅在 Apache 上生效——Nginx 请在服务器配置块中设置等效规则。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Settings changed"
msgstr "设置已更改"

msgid "Signed in"
msgstr "登录成功"

msgid "Slows down content scraping and simple floods."
msgstr "减缓内容抓取和简单洪水攻击。"

msgid "Stops the form from revealing whether a username exists."
msgstr "防止表单提示某个用户名是否存在。"

msgid ""
"Strong, and hard to undo: the browser remembers it for a year. Only turn "
"this on once HTTPS is stable on every subdomain."
msgstr "效果强烈且不易撤销：浏览器会记住一年。请确认 HTTPS 在所有子域名上都稳定后再开启。"

msgid ""
"Tested against the URL only, so content in posts and comments is unaffected."
msgstr "只检测 URL，不影响文章和评论里的内容。"

msgid "That answer was not correct. Please try again."
msgstr "答案不正确，请重试。"

msgid ""
"That password appears on lists of commonly used passwords. Please choose "
"another one."
msgstr "该密码出现在常见弱密码列表中，请换一个。"

msgid "The Pro add-on is active on this site."
msgstr "Pro 附加组件已在本站点启用。"

msgid "The audit log has been cleared."
msgstr "审计日志已清空。"

msgid ""
"The custom login path was not enabled: \"%s\" is already used by an existing"
" post or page. Please choose another one."
msgstr "自定义登录路径未启用：「%s」已被现有的文章或页面占用，请换一个。"

msgid ""
"The default wp-login.php and a bare /wp-admin/ then answer with a plain 404 "
"instead of advertising the new location."
msgstr "之后默认的 wp-login.php 和直接访问 /wp-admin/ 都会返回普通 404，不再暴露新位置。"

msgid "The human check has expired. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "人机验证已过期，请刷新页面后重试。"

msgid ""
"The list was long, so only part of it was checked — run the tool again to "
"continue."
msgstr "列表较长，只检查了一部分——再次运行工具可继续。"

msgid ""
"The login page stayed at wp-login.php: the path you entered is empty, or it "
"collides with a reserved WordPress path (such as admin or login). Please "
"choose another one, for example my-login."
msgstr ""
"登录页仍保留在 wp-login.php：你填写的路径为空，或与 WordPress 保留路径（如 admin、login）冲突。请换一个，例如 my-"
"login。"

msgid "The password must be at least %d characters long."
msgstr "密码长度至少为 %d 个字符。"

msgid "The password must contain at least one non-alphanumeric character."
msgstr "密码必须包含至少一个符号。"

msgid "The password must contain at least one number."
msgstr "密码必须包含至少一个数字。"

msgid "The password must contain both upper-case and lower-case letters."
msgstr "密码必须同时包含大写和小写字母。"

msgid ""
"The path you typed was adjusted to \"%1$s\" while saving. Your login address"
" is now: %2$s — open it and bookmark it."
msgstr "你填写的路径在保存时被调整为「%1$s」。你现在的登录地址是：%2$s —— 请打开并收藏它。"

msgid "The username or password you entered is incorrect."
msgstr "用户名或密码不正确。"

msgid ""
"These rules inspect the URL and request parameters. They are a second layer,"
" not a substitute for keeping WordPress, themes and plugins up to date."
msgstr "这些规则检查 URL 和请求参数。它们是第二道防线，不能替代及时更新 WordPress、主题和插件。"

msgid "These visitors skip every check above."
msgstr "这些访客跳过上述所有检查。"

msgid "This endpoint requires authentication."
msgstr "此接口需要身份验证。"

msgid ""
"This file name looks like an executable disguised as an image, so it was "
"rejected."
msgstr "该文件名看起来是伪装成图片的可执行文件，已被拒绝。"

msgid "This file type is not allowed for security reasons."
msgstr "出于安全考虑，不允许上传此类型文件。"

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

msgid "Turn off directory listing"
msgstr "关闭目录列表"

msgid "Two-factor authentication with recovery codes and remembered devices"
msgstr "两步验证，含恢复代码和信任设备"

msgid "Unknown action."
msgstr "未知操作。"

msgid "Use a neutral login error"
msgstr "登录错误提示中性化"

msgid "Weak-password check"
msgstr "弱密码检查"

msgid "Website"
msgstr "网站"

msgid "Website address"
msgstr "网站地址"

msgid "When"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Window length (seconds)"
msgstr "时间窗长度（秒）"

msgid ""
"Writes an .htaccess block to the site root on Apache. If your host does not "
"allow Options overrides there, the site can start answering with a 500 error"
" — check the front page after switching this on. On Nginx, use autoindex off"
" instead."
msgstr ""
"在 Apache 站点根目录写入 .htaccess 规则块。如果主机不允许覆盖 Options，站点可能开始返回 500 "
"错误——开启后请检查首页。Nginx 请改用 autoindex off。"

msgid ""
"Writes an .htaccess file inside the uploads folder itself on Apache, so an "
"uploaded file can never be executed. On Nginx, add a location block that "
"denies PHP under uploads."
msgstr ""
"在 Apache 的上传目录内写入 .htaccess，上传的文件将无法执行。Nginx 请添加一个拒绝执行 uploads 下 PHP 的 "
"location 块。"

msgid ""
"X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy and Permissions-"
"Policy."
msgstr ""
"X-Content-Type-Options、X-Frame-Options、Referrer-Policy 和 Permissions-Policy。"

msgid "You are commenting too quickly. Please wait a moment and try again."
msgstr "评论太快了，请稍等片刻再试。"

msgid "You are not allowed to access this page."
msgstr "你没有权限访问此页面。"

msgid "You are not allowed to perform this action."
msgstr "你没有权限执行此操作。"

msgid ""
"Your login address is now: %s — the default wp-login.php no longer works. "
"Open the address and bookmark it."
msgstr "你现在的登录地址是：%s —— 默认的 wp-login.php 已失效。请打开并收藏该地址。"

msgid "Your login address:"
msgstr "你的登录地址："

msgid "[%s] New sign-in from an unrecognised address"
msgstr "[%s] 有新地址登录了你的账号"

msgid "　↳ Command execution signatures"
msgstr "　↳ 命令执行特征"

msgid "　↳ Cross-site scripting signatures"
msgstr "　↳ 跨站脚本（XSS）特征"

msgid "　↳ Directory traversal signatures"
msgstr "　↳ 目录穿越特征"

msgid "　↳ SQL injection signatures"
msgstr "　↳ SQL 注入特征"

msgid "Too many failed login attempts. Please try again in %d minute."
msgid_plural "Too many failed login attempts. Please try again in %d minutes."
msgstr[0] "登录失败次数过多，请在 %d 分钟后重试。"
